  "body": "If I run a semi-public community, I might want to hand out a single invite link to my friends, trusting them to pass it around to their friends. However, if it falls into the wrong hands, i'd want to expire it and create a new one.\n\nI don't think we currently have a proposal that matchese these semantics?",
